{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01752",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 4.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable. Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.5,
      "end_seconds": 11.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Erm, not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.3,
      "end_seconds": 14.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.98,
      "end_seconds": 24.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Mainly shaky spells in the afternoon. There's a couple of other things, um, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.3,
      "end_seconds": 28.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.54,
      "end_seconds": 32.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "It's been about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.13,
      "end_seconds": 44.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.45,
      "end_seconds": 69.1,
      "duration_seconds": 23.65,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, I notice it more with missed lunch. It settles a little with sweets. I'd say a few times a day. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.23,
      "end_seconds": 87.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Any vomiting, seizure or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.12,
      "end_seconds": 92.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, um, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.0,
      "end_seconds": 95.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Sure. Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.07,
      "end_seconds": 97.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.68,
      "end_seconds": 115.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.28,
      "end_seconds": 120.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hmm, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.54,
      "end_seconds": 141.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.54,
      "end_seconds": 145.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.65,
      "end_seconds": 151.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.35,
      "end_seconds": 153.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.45,
      "end_seconds": 156.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.11,
      "end_seconds": 161.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.3,
      "end_seconds": 164.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.36,
      "end_seconds": 172.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.89,
      "end_seconds": 175.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.01,
      "end_seconds": 180.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.7,
      "end_seconds": 186.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.62,
      "end_seconds": 199.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.04,
      "end_seconds": 233.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.19,
      "text": "Okay: weight 93 kilos, height 186 centimetres, SpO2 96 percent on room air, BMI works out to 26.9, pressure 123 over 88, temperature 36.8, pulse 122."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.31,
      "end_seconds": 239.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.93,
      "end_seconds": 243.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.57,
      "end_seconds": 263.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Your sugar reading in clinic is on the low side and your pulse is a little fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.45,
      "end_seconds": 276.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "Right, all finished, thank you. Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards recurrent low blood sugar on insulin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.6,
      "end_seconds": 280.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.66,
      "end_seconds": 291.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with recurrent low blood sugar on insulin do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.7,
      "end_seconds": 304.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I want an HbA1c done, that's for diabetes review."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.06,
      "end_seconds": 308.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right, when would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.29,
      "end_seconds": 328.43,
      "duration_seconds": 19.14,
      "text": "The treatment will be insulin glargine, 16 units, once a day at bedtime, long term. That should help with diabetes. Always carry sugar and eat something before exercise. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.18,
      "end_seconds": 330.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.37,
      "end_seconds": 343.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "I'll want another look in two weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.38,
      "end_seconds": 357.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "So, you know, I take the insulin glargine, 16 units, once a day at bedtime and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.01,
      "end_seconds": 362.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.51,
      "end_seconds": 366.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}